{"id":"pfad","lemma":"Pfad","pos":"noun","rank":3368,"glosses":["path"],"ipa":"/pfaːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/De-Pfad.ogg/De-Pfad.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Pfades","plural":"Pfade"},"examples":[{"text":"Wohin führt dieser Pfad?","en":"Where does this trail go?","words":[{"g":"where to, whither"},{"g":"to lead","l":"führen"},{"g":"this one, this"},null]},{"text":"Wohin glaubst du, dass der Pfad führt?","en":"Where do you think the path leads?","words":[{"g":"where to, whither"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to lead","l":"führen"}]},{"text":"Das ist keine Straße, sondern ein Pfad.","en":"It's not a road, but a path.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"street"},{"g":"to separate, to sunder"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Es gibt einen Pfad durch den Wald.","en":"There is a path through the wood.","words":[null,null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"by means of"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"forest"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"there is, there are"]]},{"text":"Wir gingen einen schmalen Pfad entlang.","en":"We walked along a narrow path.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"narrow","l":"schmal"},null,{"g":"[with genitive]"}]}]}